2026-09-16 17:52:10,051 | INFO | nestle-platform | Utterance 3 | audio=35.0s | latency=4.256s | SPEAKER_00 | "As Don Quixote says to Sancho,  cada uno es artífice de su propia aventura,  meaning each of us is the architect of our own fortune.  At Nestle, each of us has both the power  and the responsibility to shape our company's destiny.  Through the culture we build, the decisions we make,  and the execution we drive.  It starts with our leaders and is delivered by our teams."
